<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Start And Enable The Services</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Start InspIRCd:</p>


<div class="wp-block-code">
	<div class="cm-editor">
		<div class="cm-scroller">
			
<pre>
<code><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl enable inspircd.service</div><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl start inspircd.service</div><div class="cm-line"></div></code></pre>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Start Anope:</p>


<div class="wp-block-code">
	<div class="cm-editor">
		<div class="cm-scroller">
			
<pre>
<code><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl enable anope.service</div><div class="cm-line">sudo systemctl start anope.service</div><div class="cm-line"></div></code></pre>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Check logs if necessary:</p>


<div class="wp-block-code">
	<div class="cm-editor">
